## Interface: 16001
## Title: HideUINames
## Notes: Hides all unit name tags (players, NPCs, guild, titles, pets, totems) while the UI is hidden (Alt+Z), and restores your own settings when it comes back. For WoW: Forever. Based on FlyCandy.
